WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.385 --> 00:00:15.907
looked fierce but his eyes were kind.

2
00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:20.191
"Septimus told me of your help," he said.

3
00:00:20.211 --> 00:00:23.274
"My victory will be in your honor."

4
00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:27.837
"Aquila!" Another man came over to them.

5
00:00:29.118 --> 00:00:30.900
His smile wasn't kind.

6
00:00:32.012 --> 00:00:33.013
"How are your horses?"

7
00:00:33.694 --> 00:00:34.254
he said.

8
00:00:35.355 --> 00:00:36.696
Aquila smiled too.

9
00:00:36.716 --> 00:00:39.078
"They are ready to race, Brutus.

10
00:00:40.179 --> 00:00:42.461
Melus brought them fresh water from his well."

11
00:00:43.682 --> 00:00:45.403
Brutus' face grew red.

12
00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:47.545
"What about the water I sent?"

13
00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:56.352
"It was unfortunate," Aquila said coldly, "but Melus accidentally spilled it on the stable floor."

14
00:00:58.114 --> 00:01:00.696
Brutus moved angrily toward Aquila.

15
00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:04.001
The two men seemed ready to fight.

16
00:01:04.021 --> 00:01:06.283
"Take your places!

17
00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:08.444
The race is about to begin!"

18
00:01:09.124 --> 00:01:12.406
cried Master Antonius, stepping between the men.

19
00:01:13.787 --> 00:01:15.828
Varius held Aquila back too.

20
00:01:15.848 --> 00:01:21.531
"I will have my revenge," said Brutus, walking away.

21
00:01:21.551 --> 00:01:26.533
"Enjoy the race, children," said Aquila, and left.

22
00:01:26.554 --> 00:01:28.695
"Are you okay?"

23
00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.916
Varius said to the children.

24
00:01:32.124 --> 00:01:34.486
Vinnie and Mandy nodded nervously.

25
00:01:35.626 --> 00:01:40.470
They all found seats and watched Master Antonius walk onto the stage.

26
00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:44.732
He raised his arms and the audience grew quiet.

27
00:01:44.752 --> 00:01:48.335
"Are you ready to start the race?"

28
00:01:49.015 --> 00:01:50.877
he asked the huge crowd.

29
00:01:52.137 --> 00:01:53.899
The people cheered wildly.

30
00:01:57.181 --> 00:02:01.884
Master Antonius pointed to the twelve gates at the end of the arena.

31
00:02:03.224 --> 00:02:08.407
Suddenly a horn blew loudly, and Antonius dropped a white cloth.

32
00:02:09.668 --> 00:02:13.070
The gates opened and the chariots came speeding out.

33
00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:15.471
"There's Aquila!"

34
00:02:16.091 --> 00:02:19.013
said Varius, pointing to a golden chariot.

35
00:02:20.274 --> 00:02:24.116
Aquila lashed his horses as he raced around the track.

36
00:02:24.136 --> 00:02:26.757
"And Brutus!"

37
00:02:27.598 --> 00:02:28.398
yelled Vinnie.

38
00:02:29.619 --> 00:02:31.720
Brutus was close behind Aquila.

39
00:02:32.872 --> 00:02:35.034
His chariot was red and green.

40
00:02:36.375 --> 00:02:39.758
It had a spike sticking out from the middle of each wheel.

41
00:02:41.099 --> 00:02:43.241
They raced once around the track.

42
00:02:44.542 --> 00:02:47.184
Men on the stage turned one dolphin up.

43
00:02:48.365 --> 00:02:50.207
Mandy noticed it right away.

44
00:02:50.227 --> 00:02:52.228
"One lap!"

45
00:02:52.789 --> 00:02:53.429
she yelled.

46
00:02:53.449 --> 00:02:56.192
"Go, Aquila!"

47
00:02:56.892 --> 00:02:57.913
Vinnie was yelling.

48
00:02:57.933 --> 00:03:01.276
"Vinnie! Let me see the photo!"

49
00:03:01.904 --> 00:03:02.824
Mandy shouted.

50
00:03:03.765 --> 00:03:05.205
He handed her the photo.

51
00:03:05.225 --> 00:03:08.146
"We're getting closer to home!"

52
00:03:08.826 --> 00:03:09.406
she said.

53
00:03:09.426 --> 00:03:12.287
"Aquila! Watch out!"

54
00:03:12.927 --> 00:03:13.728
cried Vinnie.

55
00:03:14.828 --> 00:03:18.009
Brutus was trying to crash into Aquila's chariot.

56
00:03:18.029 --> 00:03:24.991
"If Brutus' spike hits Aquila's wheel, Aquila's chariot could flip over," said Varius.

57
00:03:25.011 --> 00:03:28.732
"Then Aquila will be crushed under the horses' feet!"

58
00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.220
"Oh, I can't look!"

59
00:03:33.101 --> 00:03:34.581
Mandy covered her eyes.

60
00:03:36.121 --> 00:03:38.302
Aquila moved away just in time.

61
00:03:39.522 --> 00:03:43.263
Another dolphin was flipped to show a second lap was completed.

62
00:03:43.283 --> 00:03:48.765
"Varius!" Mandy touched his arm.

63
00:03:48.785 --> 00:03:50.105
"Thank you!"

64
00:03:51.226 --> 00:03:55.907
The two dolphins in the photo were glowing red as Aquila pulled ahead.

65
00:03:56.907 --> 00:03:58.928
Vinnie was cheering loudly.

66
00:04:01.416 --> 00:04:03.060
Mandy grabbed Vinnie's hand.

67
00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:07.931
"Go, Aqu Vinnie began to shout.

68
00:04:09.173 --> 00:04:11.879
Then the children fell down the dark tunnel.
